      "Successfully found 310 common genes after standardizing IDs.\n",
      "Filtered adata_ref. It now has 310 variables.\n",
      "\n",
      "Updated adata_ref.var:\n",
      "             soma_joinid       feature_id feature_name  feature_length  \\\n",
